new = '| Search page / recommendations | **Active — Build247 target-device rejected; Build248 CI/IPA verified, target-device pending** | Build247 / 0.14.80 was tested on iPhone 15 Pro Max / iOS 17.0 and rejected: the new root-owned Search Dock sat too low/outside the screen and the 60-item startup preloader left recommendations on the spinner. Build248 / 0.14.81 exact CI source `dc601099ded1074fafc0c7a4e000b8c6fd4c7338` keeps root Dock ownership but compensates `geometry.safeAreaInsets.bottom`, and restores the original up-to-3×3 recommendation contract: preload limit 9, each Suggestions request asks only for remaining slots, actual returned type remains hard-whitelisted to Movie/Series, and there is no Search recommendation load-more. Run/job `33259763303 / 99119574495` passed; artifact `9716945819`; IPA SHA-256 `8eb734bb26b77f377314223acbf7306da72ac9254a20586bfc443d59fea940c5`; MinOS 15.0 independently verified. Build248 is not real-device tested or stable yet. |'
